OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with some pleasant evening
OL,7,Fsunshine, then dry overnight with
OL,8,Flengthy clear spells. Light to
OL,9,Fmoderate easterly winds and not quite
OL,10,Fas chilly as recent nights.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FStaying mostly dry, with
OL,13,Fspells of warm sunshine. The chance of
OL,14,Fa few showers drifting in from the
OL,15,Fsouth through the evening. Turning
OL,16,Fincreasingly humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
